    "category": "Plenio/Lyrics",
    "description": "Misheard words in the lyrics as sung: the writer model reads the lyrics and every line the take sings, with the words the lyrics do not have there marked, and corrects those it is sure were misheard - with a word of as many syllables that fits the line. The release record keeps each correction with the word heard; (sung).srt is written again. Nothing runs for a song without sung lyrics or without such words."
